        "handle": "capability.C1",
        "skill_id": "genomics/snpeff-annotation",
        "purpose": "Build or use snpEff databases and annotate VCF variants with ANN effects. Use when the user asks for SNP/indel functional annotation with snpEff, including existing pre-built databases, custom GFF3/GTF/GenBank database builds, ANN interpretation, summary HTML, and safe database/version selection. Do not guess species databases, genome-version names, chromosome names, codon tables, or unchecked-build options from taxonomy labels alone.",
